     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">When I run this code<div><br></div><div>one_ind&lt;-&#39;disob_f~home_f+angfrus+calm # c and b paths<br>angfrus~home_f <br>calm~home_f# a path<br>calm~~angfrus&#39;<br>fit1&lt;-sem(one_ind,data=df,cluster=&quot;T_ID&quot;,estimator=&quot;mlr&quot;)<br>summary(fit1)<br><br>out_fit1&lt;-indirect_effect(x=&quot;home_f&quot;,m=c(&quot;angfrus&quot;,&quot;calm&quot;),y=&quot;disob_f&quot;,<br>              fit=fit1,<br>              boot_ci=T,<br>              R=10)</div><div><br></div><div>I get this error that I don&#39;t understand</div><div><br></div><div><pre aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;line-height:1.2;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in cond_indirect(x = x, y = y, m = m, fit = fit, est = est, implied_stats = implied_stats,  : \r\n  No path from ‘home_f’ to ‘disob_f’ through ‘angfrus’, ‘calm’. Please check the arguments x, y, and m.</span></span></pre><pre aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;line-height:1.2;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"><br></span></span></pre><pre aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;line-height:1.2;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Any help is appreciated, Andy</span></span></pre><div><br></div><span class=\"gmail_signature_prefix\">-- </span><br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_s