gle.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.linkedin.com/in/drandysupple&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792414335047000&amp;usg=AOvVaw22XPbOUObqoMBEgCCTnr93\"><img src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/L_su-AWiqFbTQRPL0vJhgNxD-9GM4500bMwR21CypQGyaZvbXidKzSzOY9QgjG0PMWi3Q2z_3MpxZth6PqDFFVtc=s0-d-e1-ft#https://images2.imgbox.com/cf/79/t9KpcVhL_o.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a><br></div><div><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
